WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.860
Let's do a quick overview of the Reports page.

2
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:05.260
Click on Reports.

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.900
You can see the different reports here.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.120
You can preview it.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:19.070
This already has all the columns an insurance agent would want to insure your collection.

6
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.110
You can PDF it or print it directly.

7
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.200
This is really nice if you want to take it to a show and prefer a printout.

8
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:34.240
You can have all the items you're looking for — just your wants, or maybe your parts list.

9
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.590
Here you can build a custom report.

10
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.830
You can use all the different columns you have.

11
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.060
You can then filter it, preview and sort.

12
00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:59.970
Then up here you name it and hit Save, and you can always come back to it.

13
00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:08.790
Any time you've downloaded a PDF, you can click here to see all your past reports.
